	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　Stessel’s Room'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel and Mineva were'
	R
	'drinking wine.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel was staring out the'
	R
	'window...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva was sitting in a grand'
	R
	'chair, drinking to her heart’s'
	R
	'content.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Damned Leazas...'
	R
	'I didn’t think they’d be able'
	R
	'to fight this far.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel said in a low tone.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Yep. But, well... When I heard'
	R
	'that boy became King and was'
	R
	'leading the army...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'I had a feeling this would'
	R
	'happen...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah... This is good booze.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Must be nice, getting to drink'
	R
	'good stuff like this in such a'
	R
	'poor country.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'A family could live off the'
	R
	'cost of one bottle of this for'
	R
	'ten months.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s what power gets you.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, for sure. Want money, work'
	R
	'twice as much as others.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Want power, work twice as hard'
	R
	'as others.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Pretty natural plan to follow.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'I didn’t call you here to'
	R
	'discuss this!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel slammed his fists on'
	R
	'the table.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'What I want to talk about is'
	R
	'your worthless soldiers’'
	R
	'failures!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Is our country’s army’s'
	R
	'supremacy a lie?!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Have you all been lying to me in'
	R
	'your reports?!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Nah, we’re not lying...'
	R
	'At least, I’m not.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Then...!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'What’re you getting worked up'
	R
	'about? Disgraceful.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Worked up...?'
	R
	'Me!?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'You look pretty worked up to'
	R
	'me...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Silence!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Stessel grabbed a wine bottle'
	R
	'off the table and threw it at'
	R
	'the wall.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'  ＜craaaaaaash!!）'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'The bottle smashed against the'
	R
	'wall and left a red stain.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva looked calmly at Stessel,'
	R
	'who was still breathing wildly'
	R
	'in his throwing stance.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, don’t lose your temper'
	R
	'like that.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'The next fight’ll be with my'
	R
	'army.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'My 3rd Army’s unity and its'
	R
	'will to survive are the best'
	R
	'in the country, so...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'...Hmph...'
	R
	'Does that mean you’ll use any'
	R
	'method as long as you win...?'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Guess that means they’re a'
	R
	'bunch of savages, just like'
	R
	'their general.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Yep, that’s right. We fight'
	R
	'hard. No point to it if we don’t'
	R
	'return from battle.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva casually sidestepped'
	R
	'around Stessel’s distaste.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Enough. Just win, in any case.'
	R
	'If you do, I’ll make you supreme'
	R
	'commander of the military.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Sounds great.'
	R
	'Now I really have to try hard.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Just watch, Prime Minister.'
	R
	'I’ll win.'
	R
	'See you.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva swallowed all the wine'
	R
	'left in her cup and left'
	R
	'Stessel’s room.'
