	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Or do you just not know'
	R
	'anything?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'...Do you want to...?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Do you want to be... the'
	R
	'empress of this country?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah.'
	R
	'If you refuse to move, I’ll'
	R
	'have to force you...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Sheila slowly stood up.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Please... Kill me...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t live without Mother'
	R
	'and Stessel... So...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t be stupid.'
	R
	'How could I kill such an'
	R
	'obedient girl?'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'And whether I do anything or'
	R
	'not, Leazas’ll be here soon...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Who knows whether they’ll keep'
	R
	'you alive...?'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t need to waste my...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Gh...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Guhuh!!'
	R
	'Gahah!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva tried to keep talking,'
	R
	'but suddenly fell to her knees'
	R
	'and coughed up blood.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'General Mineva...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Sheila moved to try and pat'
	R
	'Mineva’s back, and...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t feel bad for me!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Sheila was knocked by Mineva'
	R
	'into a pillar, where she'
	R
	'fainted.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_038c8:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Shit...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva left Sheila where she'
	R
	'was and sat on the throne.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Heh...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Heheheh...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Haha... Haaaahahaha!! I did it!!'
	R
	'I finally did it!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'I started off poor... All I'
	R
	'thought of was climbing higher,'
	R
	'and I made it all the way here!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hahahahahahaha!!! What do you'
	R
	'think!? All you assholes that'
	R
	'made fun of me!? Are you mad!?'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hahahah... Hahaha!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Nobody gives me orders'
	R
	'anymore... This is true freedom,'
	R
	'the freedom of having power!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mineva spread her arms, looked'
	R
	'up at the heavens, howled with'
	R
	'laughter and shouted.'
