	ZH 1:
	'Then if I beat you, I’m the'
	R
	'ruler of Helman, huh?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Guess so.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Can’t hold out forever in your'
	R
	'shape, can you? This’ll be'
	R
	'easy for me.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Maybe...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'But...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'I won’t be done in that easy!'
	R
	'I’m...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'The ruler of Helman!!'
	R
	'The strongest woman!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright!'
	R
	'A fight between rulers!!'
