	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahahaha!!'
	R
	'I finally took Helman!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah～, feels pretty good.'
	R
	'I got cute little Sheila,'
	R
	'too... Very exciting.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'This country’s part of Leazas'
	R
	'now. Gahahaha.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance. I got a report on'
	R
	'the search of Lang Bau.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm, fine.'
	R
	'Give the report.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'According to survivors that we'
	R
	'interrogated,'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Prime Minister Stessel ran to'
	R
	'the glacier area with tons of'
	R
	'gold nuggets.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Gold nuggets...'
	R
	'Nuggets made of gold?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, that’s correct.'
	R
	'Besides those, the valuables'
	R
	'amounted to...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Nothing?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Helman couldn’t be'
	R
	'called a very wealthy country'
	R
	'to begin with.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'So he took their valuable gold'
	R
	'and ran away, on top of that?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'That seems to be the case.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey!! Why do you look so'
	R
	'nonchalant about it?!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Search for this Stessel guy'
	R
	'immediately!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Unforgivable! You won’t live'
	R
	'this down, Stessel!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Everything in this country'
	R
	'belongs its conqueror, me!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'I wouldn’t even let you have a'
	R
	'single weed!!'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Find him, find him, find him!!'
	R
	'Search for him thoroughly...'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Smoke him out!!'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'There are already people'
	R
	'working on that. What I’d like'
	R
	'for you to focus on is this...'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	R
	'There’s more?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'The Western Helman cities'
	R
	'centered around Laurengrad are'
	R
	'rebelling against our control.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Most of their soldiers are'
	R
	'civilians, and I believe they'
	R
	'will be easy to suppress,'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'but what shall we do?'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph, fools. Guess they don’t'
	R
	'need their lives.'
	\L_0391b:
	ZH 1:
	'Helman’s no more.'
	R
	'Their only choice is to work'
	R
	'under me.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, we have to beat'
	R
	'it into those morons who their'
	R
	'master is.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_03866:
	ZH 1:
	'Understood.'
	R
	'I’ll have everyone prepare to'
	R
	'move out at your command.'
	\L_0391b:
	\L_0390e:
	\L_037f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
